# Applicant plan submissions (contain personal info / bank statements) — never commit.
# `/*.pdf` alone only matched root-level PDFs; applicant plans also arrive as .pptx/.docx
# and in general_business_plans/. Cover where submissions actually land: repo root and
# the applicant folder. (The BYUMS rubric CSV + judging .md stay tracked — they're config.)
/*.pdf
/*.pptx
/*.docx
general_business_plans/
